{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/c8c5f75c6935a35d7596842347a1fa3d.avif?t=1767342959\" width=560 height=200 /></span>\ud83c\udfae <br>Why Should You Play the FUR Squadron Phoenix? \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because it's not just another space shooter\u2014it's a full-throttle revival of the on-rails shooter genre, reimagined for a new generation. With sleek visuals and explosive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/27d546c82a05cdd2b4fbdcc055a4d319.poster.avif?t=1767342959\" width=560 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/27d546c82a05cdd2b4fbdcc055a4d319.webm?t=1767342959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/27d546c82a05cdd2b4fbdcc055a4d319.mp4?t=1767342959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2728 What Awaits You:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelite campaign where every run reshuffles the levels, keeping the action fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable ships, unlockable weapons, and skill trees that let you craft your own path to becoming an ace pilot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive bosses, dynamic environments, and intense battles across space, air, and sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dazzling arsenal: unleash power beams, multi-missile barrages, and even a nuke strike. Forget the basics\u2014this is war with style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/9d66df33847b6bbb168e4adc5675b227.poster.avif?t=1767342959\" width=560 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/9d66df33847b6bbb168e4adc5675b227.webm?t=1767342959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/9d66df33847b6bbb168e4adc5675b227.mp4?t=1767342959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83d\ude80 Meet the FUR Squadron:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train with a renegade crew of elite pilots using cutting-edge VR tech. Complete their missions, boost your Overdrive, and unlock story-rich conversations that reveal their pasts\u2014and yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/8d8f865e9456062478dffd807efa55e9.poster.avif?t=1767342959\" width=560 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/8d8f865e9456062478dffd807efa55e9.webm?t=1767342959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/8d8f865e9456062478dffd807efa55e9.mp4?t=1767342959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udf0c A Universe in Peril:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;War drums are beating at the Bist System. Alarmed by the increasing activity of the dangerous Marauders, the Chimera Federation has decided to reinforce the troops of its space fleet. A brave and determined recruit is sent to the renegade FUR Squadron for special training using their virtual reality technology. Will they manage to hone their skills before it's too late?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2674650?t=1767342959","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767342959","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/2171d92d0523b942a672a5a7747174a2f8ab6072/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767342959","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/2171d92d0523b942a672a5a7747174a2f8ab6072/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767342959","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3186310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/c8c5f75c6935a35d7596842347a1fa3d.avif?t=1767342959\" width=560 height=200 /></span>\ud83c\udfae <br>Why Should You Play the FUR Squadron Phoenix? \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because it's not just another space shooter\u2014it's a full-throttle revival of the on-rails shooter genre, reimagined for a new generation. With sleek visuals and explosive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/27d546c82a05cdd2b4fbdcc055a4d319.poster.avif?t=1767342959\" width=