k story-rich conversations that reveal their pasts\u2014and yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/8d8f865e9456062478dffd807efa55e9.poster.avif?t=1767342959\" width=560 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/8d8f865e9456062478dffd807efa55e9.webm?t=1767342959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/8d8f865e9456062478dffd807efa55e9.mp4?t=1767342959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udf0c A Universe in Peril:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;War drums are beating at the Bist System. Alarmed by the increasing activity of the dangerous Marauders, the Chimera Federation has decided to reinforce the troops of its space fleet. A brave and determined recruit is sent to the renegade FUR Squadron for special training using their virtual reality technology. Will they manage to hone their skills before it's too late?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Raptor Claw"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/c05357d5a2e6ad0cd1abf99b9a22e848990d0aa8/header.jpg?t=1767342959","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2674650/1662487923/8f636a2420d47318b28d6b53f154bc29d47c0be9/1759311313/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759313397","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2674650/1662487923/8f636a2420d47318b28d6b53f154bc29d47c0be9/1759311313/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759313397","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.s